Shift Time
==========

Made for GitHub Game Off 2026 by Artemiy Pridyba and Borys Shapovalov.
Source: https://github.com/ArtemPridyba/shift-time

Our own work
------------

Design, levels, code, tools and tests: Artemiy Pridyba and Borys Shapovalov,
written together with AI coding assistants (Claude Code by Anthropic, Gemini in
Google Antigravity).

Pictures: generated with the Gemini app (Google) from our own prompts and our
own game screenshots, then cut and fitted by our scripts. Every file, with its
prompt and source, is listed in docs/art/log.md. No third-party art packs.

Sound: see the sound rows of docs/art/log.md.

